# Declension: en.wiktionary.org, entry “महीना” (masculine ā-stem: महीना / महीने / महीनों).  A noun counted by a
# numeral stands in the OBLIQUE case, so the oblique forms are unit
# surfaces in their own right.
# माह is the form CLDR 47 uses for the month field's displayName and
# relative-time patterns; मास is the Sanskritic doublet en.wiktionary
# glosses “a month”.  Both are masculine consonant stems.
महीना
महीने
महीनों
माह
मास
